  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-reading-language-prereferences</b></p><a name=\"ahip-reading-language-prereferences\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-reading-language-prereferences\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>urn:ietf:bcp:47</code><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>am</td><td>Amharic</td></tr><tr><td>ar</td><td>Arabic</td></tr><tr><td>bn</td><td>Bengali</td></tr><tr><td>my</td><td>Burmese</td></tr><tr><td>yue</td><td>Cantonese</td></tr><tr><td>chr</td><td>Cherokee</td></tr><tr><td>chk</td><td>Chuukese</td></tr><tr><td>cro</td><td>Crow</td></tr><tr><td>dak</td><td>Dakota</td></tr><tr><td>prs</td><td>Dari</td></tr><tr><td>nl</td><td>Dutch</td></tr><tr><td>en</td><td>English</td></tr><tr><td>fa</td><td>Farsi</td></tr><tr><td>fr</td><td>French</td></tr><tr><td>de</td><td>German</td></tr><tr><td>el</td><td>Greek</td></tr><tr><td>ht</td><td>Haitian Creole</td></tr><tr><td>haw</td><td>Hawaiian</td></tr><tr><td>he</td><td>Hebrew</td></tr><tr><td>hi</td><td>Hindi</td></tr><tr><td>hmn</td><td>Hmong</td></tr><tr><td>ik</td><td>Inupiaq</td></tr><tr><td>it</td><td>Italian</td></tr><tr><td>ja</td><td>Japanese</td></tr><tr><td>kar</td><td>Karen</td></tr><tr><td>kkh</td><td>Karenni</td></tr><tr><td>km</td><td>Khmer</td></tr><tr><td>ko</td><td>Korean</td></tr><tr><td>lkt</td><td>Lakota (sioux)</td></tr><tr><td>lo</td><td>Lao</td></tr><tr><td>cmn</td><td>Mandarin</td></tr><tr><td>mh</td><td>Marshallese</td></tr><tr><td>mus</td><td>Muscogee</td></tr><tr><td>nv</td><td>Navajo (Dine')</td></tr><tr><td>oj</td><td>Ojibwe</td></tr><tr><td>ood</td><td>O'oodham</td></tr><tr><td>pdc</td><td>Pennsylvania Dutch (Pennsylvania German)</td></tr><tr><td>ps</td><td>Pashto</td></tr><tr><td>pl</td><td>Polish</td></tr><tr><td>pon</td><td>Pohnpeian</td></tr><tr><td>pt</td><td>Portuguese</td></tr><tr><td>ru</td><td>Russian</td></tr><tr><td>sm</td><td>Samoan</td></tr><tr><td>so</td><td>Somali</td></tr><tr><td>es</td><td>Spanish</td></tr><tr><td>sw</td><td>Swahili</td></tr><tr><td>sv</td><td>Swedish</td></tr><tr><td>tl</td><td>Tagalog</td></tr><tr><td>tnq</td><td>Taino</td></tr><tr><td>th</td><td>Thai</td></tr><tr><td>to</td><td>Tongan</td></tr><tr><td>vi</td><td>Vietnamese</td></tr><tr><td>apw</td><td>Western Apache</td></tr><tr><td>yi</td><td>Yiddish</td></tr><tr><td>zun</td><td>Zuni</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-reading-mode.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/reading-mode</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 1.0.0, the version found through the package references\"> version ?1.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-reading-mode.html#reading-mode-braille\">braille</a></td><td>Braille</td><td>A tactile writing system used by individuals who are visually impaired.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-reading-mode.html#reading-mode-large-print\">large-print</a></td><td>Large Print</td><td>Printed materials formatted with enlarged text to assist individuals with low vision.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-reading-mode.html#reading-mode-digital-spoken\">digital-spoken</a></td><td>Digital Documents that Can Be Spoken Out Loud​</td><td>Digital documents formatted to be compatible with text-to-speech technology.</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 4.0.0, the version found through the package references\"> version ?4.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://ahip.org/demographics/CodeSystem/AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.1.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor.html#AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor-CNTR\">CNTR</a></td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td><td>**Description:**This code is to represent explicitly that the patient has chosen not to respond to this question at this time</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor.html#AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor-PSIN\">PSIN</a></td><td>Please specify if not listed above</td><td>**Description:**This code is to represent explicitly that the patient would like to specify a value that is not listed above</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
